<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" class="figtree_45637678-module__gQW92q__variable mrs_saint_delafield_a610fa56-module__1FVVxG__variable"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/brand/logo-mark.svg" as="image"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/3xle5595uqzwv.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/0kzhjw53djcgg.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/3pneb80gmcbs_.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/40j26qmlkjc3v.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0b3u-dvr9ktat.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2ts65czrjjd_k.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-0hrzotfw-w7zf.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/02j-76h388h8w.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0x1f_73f0696n.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/1er8j4qx98a46.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/24shp7kyo1m_v.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><title>Pricing · pathmatics.io</title><meta name="description" content="100 free credits on sign-up, which is 5 generations. 20 credits to generate, 15 to trace an image, and credit packs with no subscription."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://pathmatics.io"/><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" href="https://pathmatics.io/blog/feed.xml"/><meta property="og:title" content="Turn any concept into scalable vectors · pathmatics.io"/><meta property="og:description" content="Describe it or upload it, and Pathmatics turns your idea into clean, editable vector art. SVG, PDF, PNG, JPEG and WebP export."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://pathmatics.io"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="pathmatics.io"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://pathmatics.io/opengraph-image?1191516828b493b2"/><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="pathmatics.io: turn any concept into scalable vectors"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Turn any concept into scalable vectors · pathmatics.io"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Describe it or upload it, and Pathmatics turns your idea into clean, editable vector art. SVG, PDF, PNG, JPEG and WebP export."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://pathmatics.io/opengraph-image?1191516828b493b2"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="pathmatics.io: turn any concept into scalable vectors"/><meta name="twitter:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="630"/><link rel="icon" href="/brand/logo-mark.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/brand/logo-mark.svg"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__header"><a class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__inner"><a class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__brand" href="/"><img class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__mark" src="/brand/logo-mark.svg" alt=""/><span class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__wordmark">pathmatics.io</span></a><nav class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__nav"><a class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__link" href="/solutions">Solutions</a><span class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__linkCurrent">Pricing</span><a class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__link" href="/developers">Developers</a><a class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__link" href="/docs">Docs</a><a class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__link" href="/blog">Blog</a><a class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__link" href="/contact">Contact</a></nav><div class="SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__actions"><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__ghost Button-module__8RiFmG__sm SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__pill" href="/auth">Sign in</a><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__solid Button-module__8RiFmG__sm SiteHeader-module__xyQu5a__pill" href="/auth?mode=signup&amp;callbackUrl=%2Fdashboard">Get started</a></div></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__wrap"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__head"><div><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__eyebrow">Pricing</p><h1 class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__h1">Credits, bought by the pack.</h1><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__lede">Every account starts with <!-- -->100<!-- --> credits, which is<!-- --> <!-- -->5<!-- --> generations. After that you buy a pack — one payment, no plan, no billing cycle, and nothing that expires at the end of a month.</p></div></div><section class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__section"><h2 class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__h2">What a pack costs</h2><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__sectionLede">One payment rather than a subscription. Credits land in your balance as soon as the payment clears, they are spent at the same price through the studio and the API, and they do not expire.<!-- --> Also priced in EUR and GBP, chosen at the checkout.</p><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__prices"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__price"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceHead"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceLabel">starter</span></div><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceAmount">$9.00</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceCredits">500<!-- --> credits</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceRate">25 generations · $0.36 each</span><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceCta"><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__solid Button-module__8RiFmG__full" href="/credits?pack=starter">Buy <!-- -->500<!-- --> credits</a></div></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__price"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceHead"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceLabel">standard</span></div><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceAmount">$24.00</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceCredits">1,500<!-- --> credits</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceRate">75 generations · $0.32 each</span><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceCta"><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__solid Button-module__8RiFmG__full" href="/credits?pack=standard">Buy <!-- -->1,500<!-- --> credits</a></div></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__price pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceBest"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceHead"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceLabel">studio</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceBadge"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceBadgeIcon"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M14.6 3.4l1.35 3.65L19.6 8.4l-3.65 1.35L14.6 13.4l-1.35-3.65L9.6 8.4l3.65-1.35L14.6 3.4Z"></path><path d="M4.4 20.6l7.1-7.1"></path></svg></span>Best rate</span></div><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceAmount">$69.00</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceCredits">5,000<!-- --> credits</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceRate">250 generations · $0.276 each</span><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceCta"><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__solid Button-module__8RiFmG__full" href="/credits?pack=studio">Buy <!-- -->5,000<!-- --> credits</a></div></div></div><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__priceNote">Buying needs an account, because credits are added to one. Signing in takes you straight to the pack you picked.</p></section><section class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__section"><h2 class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__h2">What an operation costs</h2><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__sectionLede">Prices come from the model list at the moment you call, so these are the current figures rather than a promise. The studio shows the exact cost on the button before you press it.</p><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packs"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__pack"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packLabel">Text to SVG</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packCount">20</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packRate">credits</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packTotal">A prompt, with up to four reference images.</span></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__pack"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packLabel">Image to SVG</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packCount">15</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packRate">credits</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packTotal">Tracing a sketch or bitmap. Cheaper, because the model is following rather than inventing.</span></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__pack"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packLabel">On sign-up</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packCount">100</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packRate">credits, free</span><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__packTotal">Enough for <!-- -->5<!-- --> generations. Confirm your email address and they are spendable.</span></div></div></section><section class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__section"><h2 class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__h2">Free, and staying free</h2><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__features"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__feature"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__featureMark"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span>Downloading your work, as often as you like</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__feature"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__featureMark"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span>SVG, PDF, PNG, JPEG and WebP export, up to 4096px</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__feature"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__featureMark"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span>Keeping every generation in your gallery</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__feature"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__featureMark"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span>Reading your balance, usage and statement</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__feature"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__featureMark"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span>Creating and revoking API keys</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__feature"><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__featureMark"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span>Calling the API, which bills from the same balance as the studio</p></div></section><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__values"><div><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueIcon"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M12 3.5l7 3v5.2c0 4.1-2.9 7.4-7 8.8-4.1-1.4-7-4.7-7-8.8V6.5l7-3Z"></path><path d="M9.2 12.1l2.1 2.1 4-4.2"></path></svg></span><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueTitle">A failure costs nothing</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueCopy">Credits are taken before the model is called and settled against what the work actually cost. If it fails, or you press Stop, they go back.</p></div><div><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueIcon"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="1.25"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.6"></circle><path d="M12 7.6V12l3 2"></path></svg></span><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueTitle">Nothing expires</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueCopy">The opening grant has no clock on it. There is no monthly cycle to lose credits at the end of.</p></div><div><span class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueIcon"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M4 20h16"></path><path d="M7 16V9"></path><path d="M12 16V5"></path><path d="M17 16v-4"></path></svg></span><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueTitle">Every movement is a line</p><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__valueCopy">The balance is a cache over an append-only ledger, and the statement in your dashboard shows every entry. There is an endpoint that checks the two agree.</p></div></div><section class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__section"><h2 class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__h2">Need more than the largest pack?</h2><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__sectionLede">Buying more than one pack works, and so does asking. If you are running enough volume for that to matter, tell us roughly what you are doing and how much of it, and we will price it properly.</p><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__sectionCta"><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__solid" href="/credits">Buy credits</a><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__quiet" href="/contact">Talk to us</a></div></section><section class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__section"><h2 class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__h2">Questions</h2><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqList"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqRow"><button type="button" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-0">What does a generation cost?<span aria-hidden="true" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqIcon">+</span></button><div id="faq-answer-0" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBody"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBodyInner"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqAnswer">20 credits for a prompt, 15 to trace an image, on the current model. A new account starts with 100, so that is 5 generations before anything is asked of you.</p></div></div></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqRow"><button type="button" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">Can I buy more credits?<span aria-hidden="true" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqIcon">+</span></button><div id="faq-answer-1" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBody"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBodyInner"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqAnswer">Yes. Pick a pack above — it is a one-off purchase rather than a subscription, and the credits land in your balance as soon as the payment clears. You need an account to buy, because credits are added to one, and the checkout shows the ways to pay it can take.</p></div></div></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqRow"><button type="button" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">Do credits expire?<span aria-hidden="true" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqIcon">+</span></button><div id="faq-answer-2" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBody"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBodyInner"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqAnswer">No. There is no billing cycle and no subscription, so there is nothing for them to expire at the end of. A pack you bought a year ago is still spendable.</p></div></div></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqRow"><button type="button" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">What happens if a generation fails?<span aria-hidden="true" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqIcon">+</span></button><div id="faq-answer-3" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBody"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBodyInner"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqAnswer">You are not charged. The reservation is refunded, and the refund is a line in your statement rather than a silent correction.</p></div></div></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqRow"><button type="button" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">Who owns the vectors I generate?<span aria-hidden="true" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqIcon">+</span></button><div id="faq-answer-4" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBody"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBodyInner"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqAnswer">You do. You can download them in any format offered, as many times as you like, and deleting your account takes them with it.</p></div></div></div><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqRow"><button type="button" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">Is the API priced differently?<span aria-hidden="true" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqIcon">+</span></button><div id="faq-answer-5" class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBody"><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqBodyInner"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__faqAnswer">No. A key bills from the same balance as the studio, at the same price, with the same rate limits across both.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__banner pm-on-dark"><p class="pricing-module__kvPdYW__bannerText">Start with <!-- -->100<!-- --> credits. No card, no watermark.</p><a class="Button-module__8RiFmG__button Button-module__8RiFmG__ghost" href="/dashboard">Open the studio</a></div></main><footer class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__footer"><div class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__inner"><div><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__brand" href="/"><img class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__mark" src="/brand/logo-mark.svg" alt=""/><span class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__wordmark">pathmatics.io</span></a></div><nav class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__nav"><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/solutions">Solutions</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/examples">Examples</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/developers">Developers</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/docs">Docs</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/dashboard">Studio</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/contact">Contact</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/legal/terms">Terms</a><a class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__link" href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a></nav><p class="SiteFooter-module__St6x-W__copy">© 2026 Pathmatics.io</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><div class="Toast-module__dpyMdW__region" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><script src="/_next/static/chunks/40j26qmlkjc3v.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__ne